@startuml
start
:Start;
[*] --> Unassigned

Unassigned:
    when Assign to Client -> Assigned to Client
    when Assign to Campaign -> Assigned to Campaign

Assigned to Client:
    when Remove Assignment --> Unassigned
    when Switch Assignment --> Assigned to Campaign

Assigned to Campaign:
    when Remove Assignment --> Unassigned
    when Switch Assignment --> Assigned to Client

Unemployed:
    after some time --> Archived

Archived:
    [*] <-- end

Unassigned, Assigned to Client, Assigned to Campaign:
    when Leave Job --> Unemployed

Assigned to Client <-> Assigned to Campaign: Switch Assignment

@enduml
